  "id": "60b106c0290ab0882b86b93f",
  "title": "2023下半年的徒步",
  "summary": "整理一下照片。 目录 7月15日在Stonehaven 7月22日在Loch Leven 8月05日在Tay Forest Park, Dunkeld 8月12日在Pentland Hills Regional Park 8月19日在Holy Island, Berwick-upon-Tweed 8月26日在Conic hill, Alexandria 9月02日在Mistylaw, Lochwinnoch 9月16日在Ben Ledi, Callander 9月23日在Peebles 10月14日在Peebles 11到12月 7 月 15 日在 Stonehaven 距离：21.26 千米；累计爬升：573 米；耗时：4 小时 58 分。 第一次跟群里人出去走。本来说是简单路线，中途却改成高难度的雨中悬崖…",
  "content": "<p>整理一下照片。</p>\n<p>\n<h2>目录</h2>\n<ul>\n    \n    <li>\n\t\n        <a href=\"https://emptystack.top/hiking-2023/#7月15日在Stonehaven\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">7月15日在Stonehaven</a>\n        \n    </li>\n    \n    <li>\n\t\n        <a href=\"https://emptystack.top/hiking-2023/#7月22日在Loch_Leven\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">7月22日在Loch Leven</a>\n        \n    </li>\n    \n    <li>\n\t\n        <a href=\"https://emptystack.top/hiking-2023/#8月05日在Tay_Forest_Park,_Dunkeld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">8月05日在Tay Forest Park, Dunkeld</a>\n        \n    </li>\n    \n    <li>\n\t\n        <a href=\"https://emptystack.top/hiking-2023/#8月12日在Pentland_Hills_Regional_Park\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">8月12日在Pentland Hills Regional Park</a>\n        \n    </li>\n    \n    <li>\n\t\n        <a href=\"https://emptystack.top/hiking-2023/#8月19日在Holy_Island,_Berwick-upon-Tweed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">8月19日在Holy Island, Berwick-upon-Tweed</a>\n        \n    </li>\n    \n    <li>\n\t\n        <a href=\"https://emptystack.top/hiking-2023/#8月26日在Conic_hill,_Alexandria\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">8月26日在Conic hill, Alexandria</a>\n        \n    </li>\n    \n    <li>\n\t\n        <a href=\"https://emptystack.top/hiking-2023/#9月02日在Mistylaw,_Lochwinnoch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">9月02日在Mistylaw, Lochwinnoch</a>\n        \n    </li>\n    \n    <li>\n\t\n        <a href=\"https://emptystack.top/hiking-2023/#9月16日在Ben_Ledi,_Callander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">9月16日在Ben Ledi, Callander</a>\n        \n    </li>\n    \n    <li>\n\t\n        <a href=\"https://emptystack.top/hiking-2023/#9月23日在Peebles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">9月23日在Peebles</a>\n        \n    </li>\n    \n    <li>\n\t\n        <a href=\"https://emptystack.top/hiking-2023/#10月14日在Peebles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">10月14日在Peebles</a>\n        \n    </li>\n    \n    <li>\n\t\n        <a href=\"https://emptystack.top/hiking-2023/#11到12月\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">11到12月</a>\n        \n    </li>\n    \n</ul>\n</p>\n<h2>7<span></span>月<span></span>15<span></span>日在<span></span>Stonehaven</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>距离：21.26<span></span>千米；累计爬升：573<span></span>米；耗时：4<span></span>小时<span></span>58<span></span>分。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>第一次跟群里人出去走。本来说是简单路线，中途却改成高难度的雨中悬崖小道，加上最后狂奔半小时上下坡赶火车，直接把大脚指跑出血。不过出来玩还是很开心的。</p>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230715_093453558.MP-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"1024\" width=\"771\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230715_100104850-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230715_102635529-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230715_111715191-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230715_134531186.MP-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"1024\" width=\"771\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<h2>7<span></span>月<span></span>22<span></span>日在<span></span>Loch Leven</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>距离：20.97<span></span>千米；累计爬升：302<span></span>米；耗时：4<span></span>小时<span></span>27<span></span>分。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>感觉大脚指差不多好了，所以第二周又同去了——结果更严重了。这次在<span></span>RSPB<span></span>的店里体验了<span></span>60<span></span>倍的观鸟望远镜，很爽。还碰到了训练有素的猫咪，喵！</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230722_092515692-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230722_094948254-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230722_104300232-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230722_133837344.MP-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"1024\" width=\"771\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230722_133908277-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<h2>8<span></span>月<span></span>05<span></span>日在<span></span>Tay Forest Park, Dunkeld</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>距离：20.91<span></span>千米；累计爬升：801<span></span>米；耗时：5<span></span>小时<span></span>9<span></span>分。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>记忆标签：瀑布、被局部大雨赶下山、在地下室吃火锅。</p>\n<p>这回又是<span></span>Stonehaven<span></span>那位中途升级难度的大哥带队。我们愣是在满山坡一人高的蕨类植物里爬上了山——这真的是正确的路么？</p>\n<p>群主是真的厉害，雨中跑下泥山。我撑着登山杖还差点滑到呢。</p>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230805_101252915-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"1024\" width=\"771\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230805_101845374-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"1024\" width=\"771\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230805_143618544-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230805_180005963.MP-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n<h2>8<span></span>月<span></span>12<span></span>日在<span></span>Pentland Hills Regional Park</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>距离：21.25<span></span>千米；累计爬升：1,189<span></span>米；耗时：5<span></span>小时<span></span>58<span></span>分。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这次途中开始下雨，是累计爬升幅度最大、裤子袜子最湿、拍照效果最好的一次。</p>\n<p>事实证明，鞋子防水，裤子不防只会让情况变得更糟，因为从裤子里的水会流进鞋里出不去。不过，雨天的好处是可以看到彩虹。</p>\n<p>我爬到最后累得够呛，抬头一看——群主在老前头跟着歌跳舞。WTF。</p>\n<p>这回徒步有个同龄人以为我三十了。所以说不要向陌生人散发善意，会让对方把自己看得很老。</p>\n<p>最后坐在小溪旁洗了洗沾满泥巴<span>（和牛粪）</span>的鞋。因为周围的草很高，在旁人看来我像是只有上半身一样。</p>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230812_102722472-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230812_084756050-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230812_132227878-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230812_141606258-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230812_154224786-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<h2>8<span></span>月<span></span>19<span></span>日在<span></span>Holy Island, Berwick-upon-Tweed</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>距离：28.47<span></span>千米；累计爬升：371<span></span>米；耗时：6<span></span>小时<span></span>10<span></span>分。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这次感觉一般，岛上没啥可看的。路上沾了满裤子的苍耳，挺扎的。</p>\n<p>最开始为了等后面的群友耗费了太多时间，后半段又要疯狂越野跑赶火车。等我们跑到火车站了，却发现火车取消了，因为上午撞人的事故还没处理完毕。早知道不那么拼命跑了。</p>\n<p>中途碰到个遛狗的老太太，听说我们从岛上一路走到她遛狗的地方都惊了——哎，穷鬼是这样的，靠走路打发时间和精力。</p>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230819_091052391-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"1024\" width=\"771\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230819_091531020-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230819_101429413-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230819_102303309-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230819_104351189-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230819_115129378-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230819_152154792-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<h2>8<span></span>月<span></span>26<span></span>日在<span></span>Conic hill, Alexandria</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>距离：小于<span></span>33.34<span></span>千米；累计爬升：792<span></span>米；耗时：3<span></span>小时<span></span>45<span></span>分。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>小山，旁边的湖是<span></span>Loch Lomond。</p>\n<p>有个同行的女生很像我的一位初中同学，但我已经记不清那同学的名字了。</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230826_123532358-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230826_125358333-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230826_133539396-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n<h2>9<span></span>月<span></span>02<span></span>日在<span></span>Mistylaw, Lochwinnoch</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>距离：23.55<span></span>千米；累计爬升：635<span></span>米；耗时：5<span></span>小时<span></span>42<span></span>分。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>带队大哥沉默了一路——我还以为是深沉系的呢，原来是没带够水不想开口。</p>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230902_081204639-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230902_093042503-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230902_114335907-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230902_122751540-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230902_141520463-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"1024\" width=\"771\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230902_145900770-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<h2>9<span></span>月<span></span>16<span></span>日在<span></span>Ben Ledi, Callander</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>距离：21.6<span></span>千米；累计爬升：1,017<span></span>米；耗时：5<span></span>小时<span></span>11<span></span>分。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>我等后面人时，有只蜘蛛在我腿上织网了——iNatrulist<span></span>上的大拿说蛛丝是它为下去而拉的安全绳，并不是它的房子。</p>\n<p>这次有个喜欢大喊大闹、乱扔垃圾的人。早应该离他远点的——他把我只用了第二次的登山杖划出一万条划痕。</p>\n<p>这次我们走反了，明明上山前说要陡坡上缓坡下，可最后却是从充满碎石的陡坡下的。我下山时因为紧张而没有拍照。请允许我借用群友的图片<span>（图5，注意中部上方的人有多小）</span>来展示山路线有多陡——爬完我都以为我属羊了。</p>\n<p>有位姐下陡坡后不敢继续，由群主和<span></span>Mistylaw<span></span>那次的阴沉大哥一路背下去了。等我们回到爱丁堡吃完饭了，他们三位才下山。</p>\n<p>最搞笑的是我们下车的站叫<span></span>Public\nToilets，上车的站叫<span></span>Station Road opposite\nPublic Toilets。</p>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230916_101255209-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"1024\" width=\"771\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230916_111438469-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"1024\" width=\"771\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230916_125043768-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"1024\" width=\"771\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230916_131040810-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"1024\" width=\"771\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/mmexport1694902678885-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"1024\" width=\"768\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230916_164334012-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<h2>9<span></span>月<span></span>23<span></span>日在<span></span>Peebles</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>距离：22.27<span></span>千米；累计爬升：748<span></span>米；耗时：5<span></span>小时<span></span>4<span></span>分。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>刚开始在树林里发现一个秋千。我试着荡了会，下来发现树根围聚而成的小窝窝里放了好多花朵、一个小玩偶和树枝搭起的五角星。估计是附近小孩假装德鲁伊要召唤什么。</p>\n<p>哦，然后没多久我一脚踩进了水塘里。再好的防水鞋也顶不住被水倒灌——倒楣啊，湿着袜子走了一天。</p>\n<p>路上发现了一个青铜时代的墓葬遗址，还有因为<span></span>anti-social\nactivities<span></span>而关闭的厕所——我们都很好奇厕所里的反社会行为是什么——点化粪池么？</p>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230923_084153926-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230923_115740266-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230923_093900353-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230923_130353538.MP-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230923_132012162-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20230923_142140709-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<h2>10<span></span>月<span></span>14<span></span>日在<span></span>Peebles</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>距离：22.8<span></span>千米；累计爬升：1,006<span></span>米；耗时：4<span></span>小时<span></span>54<span></span>分。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>另一条路线。</p>\n<p>碰到当地人组团打鸟<span>（为了保护风车么？忘了问了）</span>，耽误了些时间。风车又高又大，我觉得难以战胜。可是，如果我不停下它们，地球就会因为它们偏离轨道。我决定休养生息，回家吃顿好的再来挑战它们。</p>\n<p>有位当地人问我们是不是都从日本来——好像苏格兰乡下人缺少对中国的认知。我有次去<span></span>North\nBerwick，跟当地人说我从<span></span>China<span></span>来<span>（贫僧自东土大唐来）</span>。对方第一反应是：<span>“</span>Canada<span>？</span>”</p>\n<p>后面走泥地时因为前两步踩得很实，就掉以轻心了，第三步直接踩进沼泽。吓得我拔腿就跑，可是拔出来很难，再落脚又轻易陷下去了。最后冷静下来，把登山杖又抽出来，插进瓷实的地面上把自己撑出来了。还好那泥巴像史莱姆不像水，可以用手拿下来——要不湿着袜子走实在是让人心情崩溃。</p>\n<p>晚上跟着两位威士忌懂哥上酒吧试了两组<span></span>flights。感觉最有特色的是<span></span>Ardbeg\nUigeadail<span>（Oog-a-dal）</span>——但是太难入口了。喝了一圈发现水最好喝，哈哈。</p>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20231014_084048582-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20231014_112140596-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20231014_121912557-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"1024\" width=\"771\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20231014_133858999-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://emptystack.top/assets/PXL_20231014_144717725-optim.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img alt=\"\" height=\"771\" width=\"1024\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n<h2>11<span></span>到<span></span>12<span></span>月</h2>\n<p>TODO</p>\n\n      \n\n\n    <div>\n        <span>互动</span>\n        <div>复制以下链接，并粘贴到你的联邦宇宙Fediverse应用的搜索栏中，即可搜到对应本文的嘟文。对嘟文进行的点赞、转发、评论，都会出现在本文底部。快去试试吧！</div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n        <span></span>\n        <div>链接：<code>https://emptystack.top/note/hiking-2023</code></div>\n    </div>\n\n<div>\n    \n\n\n\n<br>\n\n    \n\n\n两\n\n\n二人赞过\n    <ol>\n        \n        <li>\n\n\n\n\n\n小可可乐 :ff14_mentor_pvp:</li>\n        \n        <li>\n\n\n\n\n\n黑糖 :splat_golden_egg:</li>\n        \n    </ol>\n\n\n\n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n    \n\n\n\n\n一条评论\n    <ol>\n        \n        <li>\n            <figure>\n                <figcaption><a href=\"https://mona.do/users/aapa/statuses/111412419168105103\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n\n\n\n\n\n花猫制砖厂</a>：\n                </figcaption>\n                \n                \n                    \n                    \n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                <blockquote><p><span><a href=\"https://emptystack.top/actor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@<span>actor</span></a></span> 漂亮花猫</p></blockquote>\n            </figure>\n        </li>\n        \n    </ol>\n\n\n\n</div>",
